    {
      "id": "w_c1b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 44,
      "y": 324,
      "width": 205,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Structure drawn first: the JBA\nlow, and the overnight low\nbelow it. Sell delta pouring in.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_c2t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 282,
      "y": 284,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "2    @24:13",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_c2b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 266,
      "y": 324,
      "width": 205,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The waterfall takes out the\novernight low. Tape reader\nextreme sell-side, and \"a bunch\nof dominators coming in\".",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_c3t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 504,
      "y": 284,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "3    @24:23",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_c3b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 324,
      "width": 205,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"we're limiting a little bit.\"\nSame direction, far less force.\nThe anomaly is decaying.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_c4t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 726,
      "y": 284,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "4    @25:00",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_c4b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 710,
      "y": 324,
      "width": 205,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Price is back above the\novernight low AND the JBA\nhigh. All that selling, and no\nresult to show for it.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:57:33.084Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_c5t",
